<title>USA: Dow drops 100 points in early trading.</title>
<headline>Dow drops 100 points in early trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average lost more than 100 points in early trading Friday on weakness in the bond market, earnings worries and volatility related to the expiration of options.</p>
<p>The 30-share Dow was off 112.19 points at 7,829.84 about 16 minutes after the opening.</p>
